//--------------------------------
//          Start 
//--------------------------------
title: Start
---
Narrator: This is doodlefish bay, your little slice of heaven. You spend your days drawing silly fishes amongst food and other doodles.
<<NextCamera CutSceneCameras>>
Narrator: Your doodle album is alive with so many ideas and colors.
<<NextCamera CutSceneCameras>>
Narrator: One night a storm hit your island all of a sudden. You placed your book under a tree where it would be safe from the rain!
<<NextCamera CutSceneCameras>>
Narrator: As you looked from the window, a bolt came from the sky hitting the book. It's pages flung alive spinning and sending out colors
<<NextCamera CutSceneCameras>>
Narrator: It's your doodles! They are alive and jumping mostly into the nearby water!
<<NextCamera CutSceneCameras>>
Narrator: The storm has calmed down. It's time to go collect those silly goobers and bring them back safely to their book.
<<NextCamera CutSceneCameras>>
<<declare $itemsFound = 0>>
<<declare $quest = "Catch your first doodle fish">>
===

//--------------------------------
//          ItemFound
//--------------------------------
title: ShowItemsFound

---
You found a {$itemsFound} !
=== 

//--------------------------------
//          First Fish Caught
//--------------------------------
title: FirstFish
---
<<if $quest == "Catch your first doodle fish">>
    Narrator: As you catch your first fish, he magically flies into the book stucking to it almost like a sticker.
    Narrator: It moves around the book happy to be back home!
    You: Time to finish this album and bring all of you back home.
    You: When I drew some of my doodles, I made them be picky eaters or obsessed with some items. I should keep an eye out for "bait".
    <<set $quest to "Finish the album">>   
<<endif>>
===

//--------------------------------
//          Album Finished
//--------------------------------
title: AlbumFinished
---
<<if $quest == "Finish the album">>
    You: I did it! All of my Doodle fish are back safe and sound in my drawing album!
    Narrator: As you enjoy the view of your book you notice the water still splashing. These silly doodles created replicas of themselfs
    Narrator: That goofy pencil fish and Eraser clam were busy.
    Narrator: They seem to be adapted to the water and they enjoy playing fishing with you "of course always with no hooks"
    Narrator: Time to go out, have fun and enjoy your life in Doodlefish Bay!
    <<set $quest to "Enjoy Doodlefish Bay">>   
<<endif>>
===

