//--------------------------------
//      NPC 1 Quesline
//--------------------------------
title: NPC1Introduction
---
    PLACEHOLDER: Oh boy coming out of that book sure was scary, good thing I don't get spooked easy!
    You: Hello?
    PLACEHOLDER: AAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!  Oh.. Hi!... Dont sneak up on me like that!
    You: Sorry!
    Placeholder: Wait... I know you! You are our creator! Did you really have to draw me besides Doge Fish, he won't stop barking.
    You: Sorry about that... I was actually wondering if you could help me out?
    PLACEHOLDER: Oh so you need my help? Well I did bring this fishing rod with me out of the book, maybe it could be usefull to help you collect the rest of the doodles
    You: Perfect! That will help me!
    PLACEHOLDER: Wa wa wa wait! Not so fast. I need to make sure you even are our artist!
    You: What?
    PLACEHOLDER: I will give you the fishing rod if you show me you caught one doodle fish which will prove you DID draw us
    You: That makes absolutely no sense but... ok...
    Narrator: QUEST STARTED
    <<EnableMovement>>
===

title: NPC1Incomplete
---
    PLACEHOLDER: I won't give you this fishing rod until you prove you drew us by showing me you caught one the doodle fishes!
    You: How does me catching my doodles prove I drew them?
    Narrator: PLACEHOLDER got distracted looking at the floor as you asked for explanations.
    You: Ok nevermind i'll get the fish 
    <<EnableMovement>>
===


title: NPC1Complete
---
    PLACEHOLDER: I knew you drew us! And this proves it
    You: ...
    PLACEHOLDER: I never had any doubts about you
    You: Can I have my fishing rod?
    PLACEHOLDER: The what now?
    You:...
    Narrator: You grab the fishing rod laying on the ground besides PLACEHOLDER and decide to move on.
    <<EnableMovement>>
===

